# Co-op skitch (physics phase 32): split screen, player 1 drives the crew van and player 2 skitches it. Player
# 2 joins on the board behind the parked van, grabs its bumper (grab) while both stand still, and the van
# tows them as any car would: the driving autopilot takes it west on Duboce and round the bend at 4.5 m/s,
# player 2 balancing (the balance bot holds a skitch too), let go after 12 s: Skitch, 1,828.
# The driver is not penalised: the van goes exactly where and as fast as it goes alone (sf-van-lap's start,
# solo: 13.572, -6.050 at 3.501 m/s at tick 1500), no bump, and the van does not honk at its own partner
# (a traffic driver honks at the kid on the bumper; a player's vehicle does not).
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 1 teleport 57.5 -17.8 -1.1 270
cmd 2 player2 join 60.8 -15.6 -1.0 270
tap use 30
p2 hold grab 60..1500
p2 bot balance
bot drive 57.5,-15.6 46,-10 30,-6 12,-8 0,-9 -7,-4 -8,9 -9,22 -9,34 from 100 lane 1.8 speed 4.5 corner 3 stop
run 1700
expect event vehicleEnter{name=crew_van,player=1} within 30..32
expect event skitchStart{car=2000000,player=2} within 60..62
expect event skitchEnd{car=2000000,reason=let go,points=1828,player=2} within 1500..1502
expect event comboLanded{name=Skitch,points=1828,player=2} within 1511..1513
expect van.pos.x > 13.571 at 1500
expect van.pos.x < 13.573 at 1500
expect van.pos.y > -6.051 at 1500
expect van.pos.y < -6.049 at 1500
expect van.hspeed > 3.500 at 1500
expect van.hspeed < 3.502 at 1500
expect state drive at end
expect no event honk
expect no event vanBump
expect no event bail
